window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A stand-alone novel in the Unleashed series </b></p> <p>Master Anderson - the cowboy with a heart of gold. </p> <p>Brad Anderson fights to save his family's ranch back in Colorado, but he is not alone.</p> <p>With a good head for business and his talent with the bullwhip, Brad is determined to leave his mark in the business world - and in the bedroom. </p> <p>His life will change once his secret is unleashed. </p>"; 
